{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 19, :comments ["<b>To whom do you</b> etc. <b>And you shall say, to your servant</b> etc. He instructed them to respond to each question in order: to the one who asks 'to whom do you belong,' you answer 'to your servant, to Jacob.' And to the one who asks 'where are you going,' you answer 'to my lord, to Esau,' 'it is a gift sent.' And to the one who asks 'and whose are these before you,' you answer 'and behold, he too is behind us.'"], :book :genesis, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 32, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:07:04.905913525Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}